{"id":"coincidencia","lemma":"coincidencia","pos":"noun","rank":1584,"glosses":["coincidence","agreement","match"],"ipa":"/koinθiˈdenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"coincidencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-coincidencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"No es una coincidencia.","en":"It's not a coincidence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460141"},{"text":"Presta atención a las coincidencias.","en":"Pay attention to coincidences."},{"text":"No fue una coincidencia.","en":"It wasn't a coincidence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/525296"},{"text":"En este libro suceden muchas coincidencias.","en":"In this book, lots of coincidences happen."},{"text":"Podría ser una coincidencia.","en":"It could be a coincidence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581740"}]}